Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.51,0:36:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看到你对我突然草率的举动表示吃惊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was so pleased that you were a little astonished{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.03,0:36:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真让我高兴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at my sudden.{\r}
