Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.80,0:36:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}科菲尔德花园13号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}13, Coffield Gardens, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.33,0:36:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.05,0:36:34.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更令我满意的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was able to satisfy myself that not only{\r}
