Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.63,0:36:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且地处里士满线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the bowing to the intersection{\r}
