Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.25,0:36:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恰好会在那个地方停留{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at that very spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.08,0:36:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太精彩了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's splendid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.50,0:36:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你解决了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.50,0:36:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那栋房子已经人去楼空{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There house appears to be unoccupied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.00,0:36:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奥贝斯坦显然已经离开这个国家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oberstein obviously has gone abroad{\r}
