Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.70,0:36:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他没理由害怕搜捕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has no reason to fear a warrant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.30,0:37:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也根本不会想到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to spot an amateur burglary{\r}
