Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.17,0:37:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我们就要这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but that is precisely what we're about to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.05,0:37:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, for what purpose?{\r}
