Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.60,0:37:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我不喜欢这样 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't like it, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.07,0:37:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以放哨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can keep watch.{\r}
