Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.70,0:37:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想想那位我们不能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think of the exalted person{\r}
