Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.50,0:38:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}棘手的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Serious proposition,{\r}
