Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.97,0:38:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们最好去地下室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We may do better down there{\r}
