Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.99,0:38:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.82,0:39:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别碰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch this.{\r}
