Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.72,0:39:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}血迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.46,0:40:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里也有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blood again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.38,0:40:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么看？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what do you think of that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.41,0:40:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Masterpiece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.09,0:40:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}前所未有的成就{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've never risen to a greater height.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.54,0:40:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我可不同意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I cannot agree with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.78,0:40:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从我想到尸体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The moment I conceived the idea of the body{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.06,0:40:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是被放在车顶的那一刻起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the roof of the train{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.08,0:40:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}剩下的都是显而易见的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the rest was inevitable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.55,0:41:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 新的吸墨纸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm, fresh blotting paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.32,0:41:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了掩盖痕迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's covered his tracks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.45,0:41:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.53,0:41:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有有用的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Means nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.97,0:42:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}似乎烧过旧报纸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems to have been burning old newspapers.{\r}
