Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.40,0:42:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.50,0:42:17.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么一个明显{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would a man so obviously{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.50,0:42:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又脏又乱的男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}untidy of his habits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.20,0:42:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要费心去烧旧报纸呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}take the trouble to burn old newspapers?{\r}
