Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.98,0:42:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是啊  不对 没有木柴也没有炭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but there's no, no wood or coal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.84,0:42:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.78,0:42:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.60,0:42:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.77,0:42:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}干得好哇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, well done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.80,0:42:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我们找到要找的人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed, I think we have our man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.50,0:43:01.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你来看看这两版{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you look in the agony column{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.70,0:43:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"每日邮报"上的寻人广告栏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the two remaining copies of The Daily Telegraph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.30,0:43:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们可以找到一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you will find a message from someone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.00,0:43:06.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自称皮耶罗的人发的消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}calling himself Piero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.00,0:43:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皮耶罗 皮耶罗 皮耶罗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Piero, Piero, Piero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.00,0:43:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 有了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, here we are.{\r}
