Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.00,0:43:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"但务必要完整报告"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but must have full report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.50,0:43:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"联系人皮耶罗"  下一份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Matter pressing signed Piero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.24,0:43:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错 上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, by Jove.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.46,0:43:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"周一晚九时后 门上敲两下"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monday night after 9:00, two taps, only on sills,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.81,0:43:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"交货后即付硬币"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}payment in hard cash when goods delivered,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.91,0:43:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和那条一样 署名是皮耶罗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}signed Piero just like the other one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.60,0:43:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每份报纸上都有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every paper has a message{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.05,0:43:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个自称皮耶罗人发的消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from someone calling himself Piero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.80,0:43:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是个假名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an odd name{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.40,0:43:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像奥贝斯坦这种恶棍会用的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the villain like Oberstein to use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.00,0:43:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是我们可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If only we could get the man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.50,0:43:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在另一头抓住这个人就好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the other end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.00,0:43:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 快来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson, quickly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.60,0:43:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们没时间耽搁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we haven't a moment to loose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.80,0:43:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带上报纸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring the papers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.83,0:43:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们要去哪？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.99,0:43:53.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"每日邮报"报社 正好能赶上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The offices of the Daily Telegraph, we just time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.01,0:44:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}精彩 真是精彩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Splendid job, splendid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.06,0:44:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我经常说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always said{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.81,0:44:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你愿意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'd the make best cat burglar in London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.90,0:44:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会是伦敦最厉害的贼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you put your mind to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.81,0:44:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警察可不能这么干 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't do these things on the force, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.60,0:44:17.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难怪你能比我们走得更远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No wonder you get results that are beyond us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.16,0:44:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过总有一天 你会走得太远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of these days you'll go too far{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.19,0:44:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给你和你的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you and your friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.00,0:44:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带来麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will find yourselves in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.10,0:44:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们肩负着祖国的重托 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}England home and duty, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.50,0:44:26.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甘当国家的殉道者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Motto and the oath of our country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.10,0:44:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"每日邮报"的寻人广告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The agony column of The Daily Telegraph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.20,0:44:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这是做什么用？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What use would you make of those?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.10,0:44:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看过今天皮耶罗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you seen the advertisement{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.70,0:44:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发的启事了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from Piero today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.28,0:44:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"今晚 老时间 老地点"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight, same hour, same place,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.21,0:44:45.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"敲两下 非常重要"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two taps, most vitally important,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.67,0:44:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"性命攸关 署名皮耶罗"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your own safety at sake, signed Piero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.00,0:44:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By George,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.00,0:44:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果他行动了 我们就能抓住他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if he answers that we've got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.49,0:45:26.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}醒醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.74,0:45:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.77,0:46:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以把我写成一个笨蛋 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can write me down as an ass, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.83,0:46:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这可不是我能料到的家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not the bird I was expecting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.29,0:46:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是谁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.02,0:46:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瓦伦丁·沃尔特上校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel Valentine Walter,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.79,0:46:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰姆斯爵士的弟弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir James' younger brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.09,0:46:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要看看底牌了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm beginning to see how the cards fall now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.93,0:46:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.70,0:46:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是来找奥贝斯坦先生的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came here to visit Mr. Oberstein.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.31,0:46:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认识你 当然了…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you, surely...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.28,0:46:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夏洛克 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.99,0:46:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切都水落石出了 上校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything is known, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.91,0:46:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个英国绅士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How an English gentlemen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.95,0:46:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}居然做出这等行为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could behave in such a manner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.44,0:46:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真让人费解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is beyond comprehension.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.05,0:46:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们知道你和奥贝斯坦的关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know of your relations{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.25,0:46:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也发现了你们的联系方式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and correspondence with Oberstein.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.15,0:46:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你偷了你哥哥的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stole your brothers' keys{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.11,0:46:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}复制了一套{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and had them duplicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.30,0:46:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们知道你周一晚上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We knew you went to Admiralty Office{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.90,0:46:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去了海军办公室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on Monday night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.80,0:46:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被卡多根 韦斯特发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and was seen by Cadogan West.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.52,0:46:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为一个正直的公民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Being the good citizen that he was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.06,0:46:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在浓雾之中紧紧跟着你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He followed you closely in the fog{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.78,0:46:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}穿过了半个伦敦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}halfway across London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.89,0:47:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直到你到了这所房子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until you reached this very house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.06,0:47:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之后 沃尔特上校的叛国罪上面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was then Colonel Walter that to treason{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.13,0:47:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还要加上谋杀罪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you added the terrible crime of murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.46,0:47:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.08,0:47:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not before God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.20,0:47:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我发誓 不是我干的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear I did not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.50,0:47:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就告诉我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then tell us how Arthur Cadogan West{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.00,0:47:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在你们把他的尸体放上火车之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}met his end before you placed his body{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.20,0:47:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亚瑟 卡多根 韦斯特 是怎么死的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the roof of the railway carriage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.83,0:47:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如你所说 他一直跟着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He followed me as you described{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.41,0:47:24.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到了这里的大门口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but until I was at the very door of this house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.08,0:47:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我才发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.35,0:47:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你拿着这些文件要做什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you gonna do with those papers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.03,0:48:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的头撞在了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hit his head{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.30,0:48:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大理石地板上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the marble floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.00,0:48:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几分钟以后就死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was dead in a matter of minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.13,0:48:21.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是奥贝斯坦的主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was Oberstein's idea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.03,0:48:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把不那么重要的文件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to stuff the less important plans{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.80,0:48:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放在韦斯特的口袋里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in West's pocket{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.00,0:48:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后把他扔到火车顶上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and put him on the roof of the train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.62,0:48:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是什么让你走上了叛国之路 上校？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What made you turn traitor, Colonel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.71,0:48:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有一大笔证券债务要偿还{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A stock exchange debt had to be paid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.84,0:48:43.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常非常需要钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I needed the money badly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.40,0:48:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奥贝斯坦出价5000磅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oberstein offered me five thousand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.72,0:48:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以使我免于破产 声败名裂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was to save myself from ruin and disgrace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.31,0:48:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我哥哥以前和我讨论事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brother used to discuss matters with me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.22,0:48:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他实在不应该那么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which he probably should not have done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.96,0:49:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}潜水艇计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This submarine, for instance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.09,0:49:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他怎么能想到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could he ever guess{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.06,0:49:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是他的亲弟弟背叛了他？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his own brother would betray him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.64,0:49:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最糟糕的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was the worst of all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.62,0:49:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他早怀疑我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He suspected me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.00,0:49:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.90,0:49:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能从他的眼神中看出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I read it in his eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.55,0:49:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}韦斯特出事之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And after this West business{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.21,0:49:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他再也抬不起头来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he never held up his head again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.30,0:49:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 你愿不愿意弥补你的过错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you not make reparation, hmmm,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.81,0:49:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}减轻你的羞愧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to ease your conscious{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.83,0:49:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甚至是你的惩罚？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and possibly your punishment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.84,0:49:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能怎么弥补？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What reparation can I make?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.37,0:49:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奥贝斯坦带着文件去了哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Oberstein with the papers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.98,0:49:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.13,0:49:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他说写信到巴黎的德鲁酒店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said that letters to the Hotel Delu in Paris{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.90,0:49:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以联系到他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would reach him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.60,0:49:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 那你就可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, well then it is possible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.51,0:49:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}帮我们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for you to help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.09,0:49:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过来坐下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come and sit down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.12,0:49:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说你写{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and write my dictation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.07,0:50:04.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"亲爱的先生"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dear sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.21,0:50:07.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"关于我们的交易"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in regard to our transaction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.70,0:50:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"你也许已经发现"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have now observed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.76,0:50:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"尚缺一个重要细节"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that one essential detail is missing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.34,0:50:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"我这里已有图纸"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I have a tracing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.19,0:50:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"可使其完整"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that will make it complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.94,0:50:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是真的吗 夏洛克？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that true, Sherlock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.42,0:50:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}千真万确{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.00,0:50:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}缺少什么重要的细节？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What essential detail is missing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.88,0:50:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}双阀门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The double-valves,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.63,0:50:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自动调节孔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the automatic self-adjusting slots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.41,0:50:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good heavens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.30,0:50:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是怎么知道的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How on earth did you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.50,0:50:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经是个潜水艇专家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've become quite a submarine expert{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.58,0:50:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的哥哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}brother of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.96,0:50:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now Colonel,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.90,0:50:38.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你打算要价多少？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what would be your terms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.27,0:50:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"我要额外增加500磅"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must ask you for a further 500 pounds,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.91,0:50:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"只要英镑"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}English notes please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.58,0:50:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"我期待在…"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should expect to meet you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.00,0:50:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 我们不能写这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well, we can hardly say here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.87,0:50:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奥贝斯坦会怀疑是陷阱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or Oberstein will suspect a trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.81,0:51:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在查理十字酒店的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The foyer of the{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.30,0:51:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大堂见面吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charring Cross Hotel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.60,0:51:04.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}靠近火车站{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's proximity to the railway station{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.76,0:51:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想必在国际特务中间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}renders it extremely popular{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.68,0:51:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很有名呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}amongst the international spy fraternity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.41,0:51:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你听见了吗 上校？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you get that Colonel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.89,0:51:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"下周六中午"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noon, Saturday next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.76,0:51:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果这都不能引蛇出洞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should be very surprised{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.35,0:51:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会非常吃惊的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if that does not flush our man out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.56,0:51:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}人来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's our man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.43,0:52:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好啊 布拉德斯特里特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Splendid Bradstreet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.33,0:53:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过我们的叛国者逃了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But our traitor has flown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.30,0:53:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是个小人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a damn cheat of a fellow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.77,0:53:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见了 先生们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.88,0:53:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会追他到天涯海角{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm keeping him on a long lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.69,0:53:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天气真冷啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's an R in the month{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.52,0:53:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道第欧根尼俱乐部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the Diogenes Club{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.93,0:53:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}供应最棒的牡蛎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has the most excellent oysters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.20,0:53:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想请你们两位一起来品尝一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should like both you gentlemen to be my guests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.95,0:53:28.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走吧 夏洛克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come along, Sherlock.{\r}
